      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOPixelSpectrum class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOPixelSpectrum" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOPixelSpectrum.h</declared>
        <desc>
          A single pixel from an MSImage projected as a (mz,
          intensity) record.
          <p>
            Output format of {@code -[TTIOMSImage
            pixelSpectra]}; consumed by the imzML
            writer (continuous mode -- every pixel shares the
            same <code>mz</code> NSData buffer).
          </p>
        </desc>
